[gd_scene format=3]

; The Chantry, east of the Locks' low doorway: the keepers' chapel, Mag-grip on an altar under a shaft of light. Its east wall is
; iron to try the grip on, up to a ledge with glyphs. A dead end: the way out is the west doorway.

